    <div class="one-in-seq asset-info-line"><a target="_blank" class="secondary" href="https://tien-kou-kari.github.io/misc/tg/2026-10-30">misc/tg/2026-10-30</a> / <a href="https://tien-kou-kari.github.io/misc/tg/2026-10-30/2026-10-30_17.22.35">2026-10-30_17.22.35</a> <span>2026-10-30 17:22:35 UTC+8</span></div>
